'''Ores''' are mineable blocks that spawn in certain [[Locations]]. Unlike vanilla Minecraft, ores cannot be found in most of the world. Otherwise, the ores themselves behave as expected. Many higher level ores are inaccessible via mining until reaching the {{Zone|Deep Caverns}}.

== Obtaining ==
'''Ores''' can be found on the [[Mining Islands]] and certain areas ({{Zone|Coal Mine}}, {{Zone|Gold Mine}}, {{Zone|Deep Caverns}}, {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}, {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}, {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}, {{Zone|Glacite Mineshafts}} and {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}).
* The amount of items received when mined manually is influenced by {{Stat|Mining Fortune}} and {{Stat|Ore Fortune}}.
* Their '''type''' determine the minimum {{Stat|Breaking Power}} the player must have to mine them.
* Their '''location''' determine their generation, the blocks they are replaced with when mined and their regeneration property.
