=== Oddities ===
* Unlike vanilla Minecraft, mining {{Item|Iron Ore|text=Iron}} and {{Item|Gold Ore}}s will not drop their [[File:Raw Iron.png|21px|link=]][[File:Raw Gold.png|21px|link=]] '''Raw''' variant. Depending on the following, the player will either obtain [[File:Iron Ingot.png|21px|link=Iron Ingot]][[File:Gold Ingot.png|21px|link=Gold Ingot]] '''Ingots''' or [[File:Gold Ore.png|21px|link=]][[File:Iron Ore.png|21px|link=]] '''Ore Blocks'''.
:{|
